@startuml sequence-main
title AdVerity review-ready ad pack — Main flow
footer CONFIDENTIAL — Internal use only · (c) HARA Solutions Limited & HealthCrew.ai

actor Practitioner
actor "Copy expert" as Expert
actor Approver
participant "Web workspace" as UI
participant "Ad Pack service" as API
participant "UrlGuard" as Guard
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "Model adapter" as Model
participant "ELK" as LOG

Practitioner -> UI: submit URL, brief, route, keywords, locale
UI -> API: POST /api/packs
API -> API: flag is true, session actor is the practitioner
API -> Guard: check URL
Guard --> API: public HTTP(S)
API -> DB: insert pack, evidence excerpts, role rows
API -> Model: draft (playbook as data, page as data)
Model --> API: schema-valid assets
API -> Model: criticise
Model --> API: before / issue / after
API -> Model: one repair at most
API -> API: GoogleCounter on every asset
API -> DB: insert immutable version, assets, critique, validation result
API -> LOG: ad_pack_drafted {trace_id, version_id, validator_pass, elapsed_ms}
API --> UI: JSON pack, status draft or ready_for_review

Expert -> UI: review this version
UI -> API: POST /api/packs/:id/approvals {role: copy_expert}
API -> DB: approval row bound to content_hash
API -> LOG: approval_recorded

Approver -> UI: approve the same version
UI -> API: POST /api/packs/:id/approvals {role: route approver}
API -> DB: approval row for the same content_hash
API --> UI: export_eligible true

Approver -> UI: download review extract
UI -> API: GET /api/packs/:id/export
API -> DB: recompute eligibility
API --> UI: CSV labelled review extract
@enduml
